or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, September to October ran 60% of normal and October to November ran 52% on the middle. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 36% of normal on the middle. Grid 19107 had its driest year in 2007 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
